        "formula": "Operating Cash Flow - Capital Expenditures",
        "example": "$30M OCF - $8M CapEx = $22M FCF | Apple 2023: $110B operating cash flow - $11B capex = $99B FCF. This funds buybacks, dividends, and R&D. | SaaS startup: $5M OCF - $1M server purchases = $4M FCF. This is cash available for growth or returning to investors.",
