        "formula": null,
        "example": "Build product: 40% chance of $10M success + 60% chance of -$3M failure = EV of $2.2M. | Acquire competitor: 70% chance of $6M + 30% chance of -$5M = EV of $2.7M. Acquire has higher EV. | Add 'value of waiting' option: gather 3 months of intel at $500k cost, then decide with better info. EV with intel: $3.5M. Wait.",
