        "formula": null,
        "example": "Org chart says VP Engineering decides. But everyone knows the Principal Architect has 'veto by code review.' Map her as a key influencer — get her buy-in before the VP. | The admin assistant who controls the CEO's calendar has more influence on timing than a VP. Engage them. | ONA (Organizational Network Analysis) tools: survey 'who do you go to for advice/work decisions?' The resulting graph reveals real influence.",
