        "formula": null,
        "example": "Wrong frame: 'Should we acquire Company X?' Right frame: 'What is the best way to enter the European market?' Acquisition is one OPTION within a broader frame. | Wrong: 'How do we reduce costs 10%?' Right: 'How do we become sustainably profitable?' Cost-cutting is one lever, not the only one. | Framing checklist: 1) What problem are we solving? 2) Who is the decision-maker? 3) What's in scope and out of scope? 4) What's our time horizon? 5) What perspective are we taking? (customer, shareholder, employee?)",
