        "formula": null,
        "example": "Amazon practice: Bar Raisers are senior employees from different departments who have conducted 100+ interviews and been trained in behavioral assessment. They participate in every interview loop. | Bar Raiser asks: 'Would I admire this person?' 'Will this person raise the average?' 'Could this person teach me something?' | Impact: prevents 'hire fast, regret slow' cycles. Hiring manager is desperate to fill the seat. Bar Raiser has no such pressure. Independent quality gate. | Training: Bar Raisers must demonstrate ability to write evidence-based feedback. 'She is smart' is rejected. 'She redesigned the database schema, reducing query time 80%, with concrete example' is accepted.",
